  "sa-star-ve": "Saturn in a nakshatra of Venus: The texture of the profession is shaded by wealth, art and partnership.",
  "sa-star-sa": "Saturn in a nakshatra of Saturn: The texture of the profession is shaded by labour, duty and long service.",
  "sa-star-ra": "Saturn in a nakshatra of Rahu: The texture of the profession is shaded by foreign lands, technology and the unconventional.",
  "sa-star-ke": "Saturn in a nakshatra of Ketu: The texture of the profession is shaded by research, healing and detachment.",
  "ve-star-su": "Venus in a nakshatra of Sun: The spouse's character is shaded by authority, government and the father's line.",
