  "ra-lord-su": "Rahu in a sign of Sun: foreign or unconventional matters express through father, authority, government.",
  "ke-lord-su": "Ketu in a sign of Sun: detachment and past-life skill touch father, authority, government.",
  "ra-lord-mo": "Rahu in a sign of Moon: foreign or unconventional matters express through mother, mind, public.",
  "ke-lord-mo": "Ketu in a sign of Moon: detachment and past-life skill touch mother, mind, public.",
  "ra-lord-ma": "Rahu in a sign of Mars: foreign or unconventional matters express through siblings, land & property, courage.",
  "ke-lord-ma": "Ketu in a sign of Mars: detachment and past-life skill touch siblings, land & property, courage.",
  "ra-lord-me": "Rahu in a sign of Mercury: foreign or unconventional matters express through education, speech, commerce.",
  "ke-lord-me": "Ketu in a sign of Mercury: detachment and past-life skill touch education, speech, commerce.",
  "ra-lord-ju": "Rahu in a sign of Jupiter: foreign or unconventional matters express through the native, children, wisdom.",
  "ke-lord-ju": "Ketu in a sign of Jupiter: detachment and past-life skill touch the native, children, wisdom.",
